/* ============================================================
   JOB:      STI_CA_D_APNS_DATA
   STATUS:   PROD
   PURPOSE:  Operational - APN Campaign Data to Adobe
   ============================================================
   CHANGE LOG
   ----------
   FIX 1  (Sec 8)  : Added cust_no = ucn in Adobe_recent_drops.
                     ADOBE_DROP_OFFS_DATA has no cust_no column;
                     ucn (numeric) is the matching identifier.
                     Without this every drop-off row entered the
                     join with cust_no2 = . causing zero matches.

