                     testindicator $6 before the SET.
                     SAS anchors character variable length to the
                     first literal it encounters; "TEST" (4 chars)
                     was silently truncating "Actual" -> "Actu"
                     and long Adobe/Client strings to 4 chars.

   FIX 4  (Sec 12) : Existing BETWEEN fix retained.
                     missing() used for numeric cust_no2 /
                     date_loaded. nodupkey sort retained.

   FIX 5  (Sec 12) : BETWEEN window widened from + 5 to + 60.
                     Analysis showed Adobe loads occurring up to
                     46 days after the optimise date. The original
                     + 5 window was silently dropping ~409k valid
                     matches causing blank Adobe values for all
                     Sent records. "Sending to Adobe" and "Not
                     loaded" thresholds updated to match.
   ============================================================ */

